---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-21 - Export Own Record
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor STU as Student
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as StudentDataController
    participant S as StudentDataService
    participant K as IAttributeKeyService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    STU->>W: Settings - "Export my data"
    W->>C: GET /api/StudentData/me/export
    C->>S: ExportMyDataAsync(StudentId)
    S->>R: Account, profile, current STUDENTDATA rows, own cases, own access log
    R->>DB: SELECT
    S->>K: DecryptValuesAsync(own values) (no consent check, not logged)
    S->>S: Build JSON document
    S->>S: Log activity dataExported
    S-->>C: ExportStudentDataResponse (file name, content type, bytes)
    C-->>W: File download (application/json)
